.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/files/Accent_Chair_The_Secret_to_a_Stylish_Space_2.jpg?v=1745378937&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1" width="1600" height="1600" sizes="75vw" data-action="url" data-href="/products/sherpa-barrel-chair-with-ottoman-h72" data-target="_blank" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-kMriOJ jsCfBi pf-39_ pf-image-1" store="[object Object]"/></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-40_"><p class="sc-dPZUdm eeluBw pf-41_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-19536102-8649-4d48-9f4a-385d7b2a1c6e"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content ">How to style your accent chair like a pro? Here are some ways to make it work in any space:<br><br><strong>Play with Contrast:&nbsp;</strong>If your sofa is neutral, go bold with a rich color (emerald green, mustard yellow, or deep blue).For colorful spaces, balance the vibrancy with textured neutrals like linen, bouclé, or leather upholstery.<br><br><strong>Mix &amp; Match (But Keep It Balanced):&nbsp;</strong>Pair a modern chair with a vintage rug or a curved design with angular furniture.Stick to 1-2 standout materials (e.g., wood + velvet) to avoid visual chaos.<br><br><strong>Give It a Purpose:</strong>&nbsp;Add a side table and lamp → Instant reading corner.Place it near a window → A sunny relaxation spot.Float it in an open space → A stylish standalone statement.<br><br><strong>Accessorize Thoughtfully:</strong>&nbsp;A throw blanket or small pillow can match the scheme of the room.Keep the surrounding decor simple&nbsp;- let the chair be the star.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-44_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-45_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-ePDMnc jGJiiy pf-46_ pf-heading-1-h3"><strong>Why the Colamy H72 Accent Chair Belongs in Your Home?</strong></h3><p class="sc-dPZUdm eeluBw pf-48_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph4"><input type="checkbox" id="compact-70960c7f-5fdc-45cf-a692-cfe93a6e6e28"/><span class="pf-paragraph-content "><br>Looking for the perfect blend of style + comfort? Meet the Colamy H72 Accent Chair—a favorite for good reason:<br></span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-hzhKNl fltMam pf-51_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fsvrPk ezIRGP pf-52_"><img alt="Accent Chair The Secret to a Stylish Space 4.jpg__PID:c2bb5a3d-a89b-474f-8a41-a797175c32e7" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0685/2739/1017/fi